# Line endings are pinned, not left to core.autocrlf.
#
# The parser test suite compares recorded output byte for byte, and that output
# includes verbatim-region byte counts and diagnostic caret columns. If a clone
# checked out CRLF, every one of those numbers would shift and the whole suite
# would fail for a reason that has nothing to do with the parser.

* text=auto eol=lf

# cmd mis-parses an LF-only batch file, so this one must be CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.exe binary
*.obj binary
*.pdb binary
